B.JE=new A.mf("Relative Clauses (Defining & Non-defining)","Defining clauses identify which person/thing we mean (no commas). Non-defining clauses add extra information (with commas). In defining clauses, who/which/that can be omitted when they are the object. Reduced relative clauses use participles.",B.MP,B.NT,"B1")
