B.Qx=s(["The Earth goes around the Sun.","Water is H two O.","Plants need sunlight.","Animals need food.","The moon shines at night.","Stars are very far away.","Rain comes from clouds.","Ice is frozen water.","The sky is blue.","Gravity keeps us down.","The ocean is very deep.","Trees give us oxygen.","Fire is very hot.","Sound travels through air.","Science helps us understand."],t.s)
